  "description": "The extraction brain. Reads document context together with a table cell by cell, \nand runs a validator pass that double-checks the extracted values on disagreement, \nreconciling and tie-breaking before emitting fully-qualified facts. Each fact carries \nthe user-configured target fields plus auto-attached provenance (page, table id, row, \ncolumn, source text, and a confidence score) so downstream consumers can trace every \nvalue back to where it came from.",
  "documentation": "https://docs.rocketride.org",
  "icon": "util-text.svg",
